WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.829 --> 00:01:09.610
So, the time has come to say farewell to all
of you.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:14.370
I must say this time our Tour has been really
very successful.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:20.490
There have been no obstructions no problems
nothing, except for one stupid article, we

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:25.990
had no problem and which they are going to
look after.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:32.960
On the whole, we have learnt a lot this time
and I think everybody has been feeling very

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.870
much better because of Shivratri Puja.

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:40.310
I’ve got reports from other countries that
they said Mother: ‘What did You do this

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:47.210
time on Shivratri that we all felt so much
higher and better’.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:02:01.310
Now the, few things I have to tell you that,
luckily you have a very good National leader

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:09.611
here, who has brought you all round very wise
person, and he is a very gentle as well as

00:02:09.611 --> 00:02:29.160
very sensible person, and who has done, such
a good work that really I must say it’s

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:44.280
very remarkable, and now I have decided to
separate his work with National.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.709
See we Indians feel very hot anywhere.

00:02:47.709 --> 00:02:56.880
We have too much of sun within us I think.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:09.000
So, there, one has to be thankful for that,
that you have such a nice leader here.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:15.340
Now I have to tell all the people specially
from Melbourne, that you should not take things

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:23.220
into your hands, and start another sort of
an organization, arbitrarily doing something

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:28.150
under some lady like that Trish.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:33.520
If you have any problems you can always write
to Me I’ve told so many times, but Australians

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.600
don’t write to Me is My main complaint about
them.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.390
And they should not start anything.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:43.950
I’m surprised that there are so many Indian
girls in Melbourne and they also did not understand

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.370
that they have to write to Me.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:54.290
So, once you are caught up you get lost, you
get vibrations in a very funny way so much

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:58.650
so that I can’t even really treat them in
this short time.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.650
So there is a list of people.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.650
Can you bring the list?

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:05.170
I’ve made the list now, please write it
down.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:09.150
Is there anybody from Melbourne here?

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:10.709
Yes.

00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:20.939
Go and tell them, that you have to get all
these people every day, to sit down, Sunday

00:04:20.939 --> 00:04:24.819
morning maybe, and see what sort of vibrations
you have.

00:04:24.819 --> 00:04:36.889
You can see it on the candle, there’s not
to go anywhere, just on the candle you can

00:04:36.889 --> 00:04:44.960
understand, what’s wrong with you, and,
you are getting caught up.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:50.260
I’m surprised that you are supposed to be
Sahaja Yogi how could you not feel the vibrations

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.800
of this woman Trish.

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:58.569
It took Me not even a second to know that
she is a bhoot.

00:04:58.569 --> 00:05:03.339
But there’s a fraternity I think, that’s
why such nice Sahaj Yogis beautiful Sahaj

00:05:03.339 --> 00:05:06.490
Yogis, got involved into it.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:11.089
So this is a very serious thing and I hope
this doesn’t happen next time.

00:05:11.089 --> 00:05:12.089
Now the list is like this.

00:05:12.089 --> 00:05:13.089
I made the list.

00:05:13.089 --> 00:05:14.150
Can somebody read it for Me.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.150
Please, take it.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:23.830
It’s a serious thing, otherwise you’ll
be lost, I’m telling you.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:30.139
Leader: Michael Davies, Jackie Hodge, Peter
Hodge,

00:05:30.139 --> 00:05:33.210
Shri Mataji: Go slowly.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:38.820
Leader: Mother shall we give them a photocopy
of this?

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:45.669
Shri Mataji: Still you read it.

00:05:45.669 --> 00:06:00.869
Leader: John Poulianakis, Fred Millar, Ian
Lowry, Greg Bradshaw, Lyndon DeValle, Philip

00:06:00.869 --> 00:06:27.610
Noone, Martin Purcell, Colin Berry, Jeff Platford,
Bruno Archello, Glen Pulolovich, Ben Flora,

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:37.330
Savita Noone, Cheryl Bradshaw and Helen Platford.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:43.680
Shri Mataji: They are all first class Sahaj
Yogis I tell you, all of them.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:51.649
And it’s really beyond Me, even when he’s
reading the thing I’m getting on the left,

00:06:51.649 --> 00:06:53.520
you just see, you’ll feel it, terrible.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:54.520
Getting the pain here.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:55.520
Now how are they going to be all right?

00:06:55.520 --> 00:07:00.569
I’m worried about them.

00:07:00.569 --> 00:07:06.680
Now also in Melbourne, I thought I’m sending
a very very good sensible leader.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:16.149
But I don’t know why people, got after him,
and formed a group outside.

00:07:16.149 --> 00:07:24.319
If I am sending somebody, I should know that
I know what I am doing.

00:07:24.319 --> 00:07:31.550
So you become anti Me or what?

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:41.129
So please all those people, who have got,
these problems, work it out every night, every

00:07:41.129 --> 00:07:48.339
morning on the three candle treatment, and
you can go in the garden, sit down there,

00:07:48.339 --> 00:07:49.800
also say Ganesha’s mantras.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:55.009
It will take some time for you to be all right,
I can tell you.

00:07:55.009 --> 00:07:58.439
Even taking their names you get left swadisthana,
aren’t you getting left swadisthana, the

00:07:58.439 --> 00:08:05.400
whole left.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:12.039
This can happen to anyone, because somebody
like that comes up and starts her own.

00:08:12.039 --> 00:08:17.069
Anything without the leader should not be
done.

00:08:17.069 --> 00:08:26.919
They went to such a limit, that they have
taken out the name out of the list of telephone

00:08:26.919 --> 00:08:32.969
of these people, can you imagine.

00:08:32.969 --> 00:08:35.300
This is too arbitrary, it’s very dangerous.

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:40.630
It should not happen anymore.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:46.560
People are very good at combining together
when it is some sort of a, negativity.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:53.750
You see if you want to hate someone, immediately,
fundamentalists will join together to hate

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.040
someone.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:09:05.120
Now for Adelaide I would say, Adelaide has
one problem also people are very arbitrary,

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:12.820
they have given Me lots of trouble before,
and if they want Me to come back, now I have

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:21.450
asked Michael Sweet, because he’s quite
good at organizing, to organize all the people

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.750
in Adelaide.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:23.750
And please support him.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:28.270
Now don’t get after his life now.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:41.420
That shows that the leaders who are unscrupulous,
who are dishonest, are more appreciated and,

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:48.760
can dominate people, while those who are good
nice people, are to be dominated.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:54.350
So please in Adelaide, unless and until you
have an Ashram I’m not going to come there.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:10:01.110
Get an Ashram, all of you shift to the Ashram
and work it out.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:06.900
If twenty-five people Sahaj Yogis cannot live
together, how do I expect the whole world

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:10.090
to be there?

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:17.520
Just think of our vision.

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:23.110
Then Wollongong, another thing, the other
day we had very nice people, I don’t know

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:27.590
how Sahaj Yogis are working out Wollongong.

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:35.540
They have to have, a proper Ashram, no individual
houses.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:36.540
Same in Newcastle.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.690
You all can have a big house.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:45.170
Now these are the best days when you can take
a house on rent.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:52.220
It’s such a God sent thing now for us, that
you can really get a house for a such a cheap

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:53.890
price.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:11:03.360
Take a big house outside, outside the city
somewhere, not in the city, and sit down with

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.680
your meditation.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:13.210
I hope you must have realized, that a very
great work, we are doing in Sahaj Yoga, the

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:21.360
greatest of greatest, and you are all part
and parcel, of that work.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:30.500
So please try, to find out methods by which
you all could be closer, and understanding

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.790
each other, loving each other.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:40.400
Also beware of Indian girls, in this respect,
they have a tendency, that’s what everybody’s

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.520
informing, that they always want to separate
out and Indian boys also.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.280
Otherwise they are all right.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:55.150
But one of the reasons I know now why it is,
that you see the girls, or the boys, from

00:11:55.150 --> 00:12:01.720
the west have led a different type of a life
a very different culture, and we can say it’s

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:10.570
not Sahaj, and they try to tell them, what
kind of a life they have led, and that makes,

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:14.020
them very miserable and they develop a nausea
with that.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.630
Then they are frightened.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:21.600
We don’t have to discuss these things with
anyone, past is past is finished why do you

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:25.490
want to talk of that, filth now?

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:30.550
So, nobody has to discuss about the filth
through which they have come out.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:40.110
Do you mean to say that when the lotuses come
out, do they talk, or do they smell of the

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:44.330
filth out of which they have come out.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.330
No.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.170
They spread fragrance.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:54.120
In the same way now you are lotuses, try to
assume your powers.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:59.210
Even if you put somebody on the throne and
make him king, still he is in a beggarish

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.210
way.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:03.150
Everybody comes, he says; ‘Give me one dollar.’

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.250
Then what to say?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.980
It’s the same situation.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:14.020
Now you are out of it, finished now, so don’t
discuss these dirty things and filthy things,

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.230
that’s why these Indians are frightened.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:23.570
Because there is a cultural difference, and
they want to run away.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.970
So if you don’t talk about it, they’ll
be all right.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:27.970
Don’t discuss.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:31.440
It’s filthy it’s dirty why to discuss
it?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:39.600
I’ve told hundred times when you are getting
married, not to talk about your past.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:43.990
There’s no confession and all that in Sahaja
Yoga, you know very well, and people write

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:49.230
to Me and you’ll be surprised twelve pages
fourteen pages, of their confessions.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:52.400
‘I’m trying I’m trying’.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:57.790
I don’t read even one word out of it because
immediately I know the filth is there.

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:58.970
Burn it off.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:03.240
So no use writing to Me also, I don’t want
to know.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.240
Finished.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:07.220
I don’t know what is the need for you to
write all these things.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:09.300
There’s no need to write.

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.670
All right?

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:17.070
After all you are My children, how you are
born, is important than from where you came

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.350
is not important.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.920
You are all beautiful people.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.230
I’ve already told you what you are.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:30.550
Believe Me, you can check out whatever I’ve
said is true or not.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.420
Also I’ve told you as I work without taking
any money, you too work without taking any

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:38.020
money don’t you?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.820
So please don’t discuss these things.

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:45.740
It’s not worth discussing talking, filth.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:51.690
If some outsider starts tell them now we don’t
want to talk about.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:54.800
It’s finished now, it’s gone.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:59.930
That’s how things are working out now properly.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:07.190
You see I depend on you very much for one
reason that you are from Ganesha’s country.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:13.100
If you just know how to forget it, it can
be worked out.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:18.220
You are Shri Ganeshas in the sense, that you
are now innocent.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:22.430
Innocence is born within you, there’s a
fragrance of innocence.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.980
Why do you want to remember those dirty things.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:30.500
Now I’m telling you again, if I hear from
anyone, that anyone is discussing this, then

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.790
we’ll ask them to get out of Sahaja Yoga.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.940
Because why do they want to remember the filth?

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:39.550
Again go back to the same filth then.

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:41.550
All right?

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:47.370
This is not to be done again, please.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:51.760
So now we’ll come to another point of schooling
the children.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:59.670
I find that, still people are very money oriented,
as far as the school is concerned.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:03.710
Very money oriented.

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.060
Very.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:12.400
Now for Indian schools we have calculated,
how much money will be needed and we have

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:21.790
to also, spend some money for equipping that
to equip, that school.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.300
Nobody is eating money there, for heaven’s
sake.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:28.589
As soon as it comes to Indians immediately
we’ll say, he eats money.

00:16:28.589 --> 00:16:34.541
And when so many have eaten money in schools
here, Australians, nobody even thought they

00:16:34.541 --> 00:16:38.040
will eat money.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:45.050
So, try to understand, is much less the price
that you are paying here, even for preschool.

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:52.700
While, not only it’s education, but also
food, also other amenities they have to travel

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.700
and this.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:58.330
There is some little profit if they get will
be good idea so that we can equip them.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.840
Now we have to build a high school.

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:03.300
Who is going to pay for the building?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:07.360
Is school for your children, not for Indian
children.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:16.509
Who is going to pay?

00:17:16.509 --> 00:17:18.630
So that is it.

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:24.819
We have to have for, even for middle school
that is after the sixth of seventh that, what

00:17:24.819 --> 00:17:32.590
you call this sixth class you call it or fifth
class, we have to have computer.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.169
They have to learn about computer.

00:17:34.169 --> 00:17:39.450
Indian schools are not like this.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.960
They have to have a science laboratory.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:47.100
If you see the subjects they have to learn
you’ll be amazed.

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:54.870
English they have to know grammar very well,
they must have proper spellings, proper handwritings.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:18:03.470
This is the minimum, I’m saying the minimum
of minimum.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:09.669
My grandson was studying in a school, it’s
a very well know school [INDIAN NAME] School

00:18:09.669 --> 00:18:13.039
and they were paying much more there it’s
a very famous…

00:18:13.039 --> 00:18:18.529
We have private schools which we call them
as public schools and they’re all, somewhere

00:18:18.529 --> 00:18:20.169
away from the cities.

00:18:20.169 --> 00:18:23.740
He was paying much more.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:31.649
But when he joined another school in Delhi,
which is a day scholar, he had to pay seventy-five

00:18:31.649 --> 00:18:37.950
thousand rupees only to enrol himself, and
every month he is paying ten thousand rupees

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:46.049
when he is just a day scholar, in Delhi.

00:18:46.049 --> 00:18:53.720
And this school is going to be much better,
much more equipped, various things we’ll

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:55.490
be doing.

00:18:55.490 --> 00:19:00.559
But every time I find such a money orientation
about schools.

00:19:00.559 --> 00:19:03.169
Same about preschool I’ve seen it.

00:19:03.169 --> 00:19:11.620
See we must understand that children are to
be educated by us.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:17.240
The first thing is you should never doubt
the teachers, no way.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.370
You must respect.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:22.190
This is what is lacking in your education
here.

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:26.440
That’s why children have no respect for
anyone.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:30.200
I told you the story, again I’ll tell you
the same story.

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:40.890
That my father, had a, generous habits of
educating boys from poor classes.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:45.830
That all we do, if we have money we just don’t
put it for ourselves and indulge into it but,

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:51.940
we always try to help our poor relations or
poor people.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:54.470
So he always had four five boys studying.

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:57.830
They stayed in our house and they looked after
them.

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:02.419
One of them, did his matriculation then he
was doing his intermediate.

00:20:02.419 --> 00:20:06.429
He felt little obliged and he said: ‘Sir
if you allow me I would like to teach your

00:20:06.429 --> 00:20:07.429
children’.

00:20:07.429 --> 00:20:09.779
He said: ‘All right go ahead’.

00:20:09.779 --> 00:20:17.580
We had two, gates to enter the house one,
which went through the, courtyard another

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.750
through his office.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:23.249
One day I don’t know why he came through
his office and immediately my father stood

00:20:23.249 --> 00:20:24.249
up for him.

00:20:24.249 --> 00:20:29.399
Know he was extremely embarrassed you see,
he didn’t know, just thought, everybody

00:20:29.399 --> 00:20:30.399
got up.

00:20:30.399 --> 00:20:32.159
Who is this gentleman has come?

00:20:32.159 --> 00:20:37.121
Then he went inside, and he told My mother
that: ‘I touch your feet but tell Sahib

00:20:37.121 --> 00:20:42.450
not to get up for me it is too much I can’t
just bear it’.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:46.159
My father came in and he said: ‘Why should
you be embarrassed?

00:20:46.159 --> 00:20:54.220
If I don’t respect you, then my children
won’t respect you.’

00:20:54.220 --> 00:21:00.570
You must try to be nobler people, it’s ignoble
habits, should be given up otherwise your

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:05.539
children will be ignoble.

00:21:05.539 --> 00:21:09.379
Now whatever has to be paid to the teachers
has to be paid.

00:21:09.379 --> 00:21:14.100
Apart from that sometimes, you must in the
presence of children you must try to give

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:17.650
them some presents or some flowers, respect
them.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:24.820
That’s what they do in India, and why most
of the rich people donate money.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:33.330
Absolutely if they have more money they donate,
money to the schools, that’s a sign of a

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.480
noble person.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:39.350
For a Sahaja Yogi it is important.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:44.230
Supposing now we have somebody who doesn’t
have money or maybe not a job, and he cannot

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:45.230
educate.

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:50.100
Now this is a good Sahaja Yogi who has been
in Sahaja Yoga for two three years, has been

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:52.970
giving realizations to people but he doesn’t
have a job.

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:59.210
It’s our duty in a way, to support his children
to be educated.

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:02.330
See when this hand is self-supporting is all
right.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:06.559
I mean this is self-supporting is all right,
but in case it needs the support of this,

00:22:06.559 --> 00:22:13.840
this has to give the support.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:20.049
As we call scholarships or sometimes we call,
now we have got at least five or six children

00:22:20.049 --> 00:22:25.159
in our school there, who are absolutely free,
absolutely.

00:22:25.159 --> 00:22:30.590
Food, some of them I am supporting, some of
them Yogi’s supporting and some of them

00:22:30.590 --> 00:22:32.129
are absolutely free, absolutely hundred percent.

00:22:32.129 --> 00:22:35.860
Will not tell you the names.

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:40.950
Their food their clothes everything and nobody
knows.

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:46.399
We don’t want them to develop a feeling
[INAUDIBLE around?].

00:22:46.399 --> 00:22:52.549
So all the time, to be very calculating about
things is bad.

00:22:52.549 --> 00:22:59.639
I’ve seen a complete, manifesto typed [INAUDIBLE]
I don’t know what, about having a committee

00:22:59.639 --> 00:23:03.830
on top of this little preschool.

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:05.230
That is not proper.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:11.700
It’s conditioning, everything, even if you
have to put these, balloons you’ll have

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.860
a committee.

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:20.450
This committee on top of that another committee
another.

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:27.370
Trust, trust and trust.

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:33.049
We have now one committee I had to do it,
is called as the finance committee all right.

00:23:33.049 --> 00:23:40.190
They are all audits, experts and accountants
and they will be here in Sydney.

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:44.759
That doesn’t mean Sydney is dominating as
someone.

00:23:44.759 --> 00:23:51.559
Some subjects have to be central, as in any
government.

00:23:51.559 --> 00:23:57.460
That you should understand, and that these
can go and see your accounts if they’re

00:23:57.460 --> 00:24:01.840
all right or not.

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:11.610
But nobody has to dominate in Sahaja Yoga,
we have to help support and trust.

00:24:11.610 --> 00:24:18.029
Now in this preschool I find there are only
seven children of that age group who are studying.

00:24:18.029 --> 00:24:20.549
There are smaller children also.

00:24:20.549 --> 00:24:26.919
I have suggested to him that why not use this
area for the school there’s a school there.

00:24:26.919 --> 00:24:30.340
And I would like children to be in My Room
than anybody else.

00:24:30.340 --> 00:24:32.710
So use this.

00:24:32.710 --> 00:24:37.700
You save money like that and children will
feel comforted.

00:24:37.700 --> 00:24:43.840
Everybody should see if they have time what
can I do for children, can I come and help

00:24:43.840 --> 00:24:44.840
you.

00:24:44.840 --> 00:24:48.809
Instead of that, how much money you spend
this that.

00:24:48.809 --> 00:24:52.929
You see there’s no income tax in Sahaja
Yoga, is there?

00:24:52.929 --> 00:24:56.489
We want to get rid of these kind of things.

00:24:56.489 --> 00:25:01.029
Everybody feels frightened and insecure, all
the time.

00:25:01.029 --> 00:25:03.190
Forget about these things.

00:25:03.190 --> 00:25:04.190
Trust.

00:25:04.190 --> 00:25:10.309
You don’t know how many thousands of dollars
I’ve lost, by trusting people.

00:25:10.309 --> 00:25:11.309
Thousands.

00:25:11.309 --> 00:25:13.899
But we have to trust.

00:25:13.899 --> 00:25:15.889
What can you do?

00:25:15.889 --> 00:25:18.870
We have to pay for our principles.

00:25:18.870 --> 00:25:26.990
The main principle is trusting and not to
ask about money where is what what is right.

00:25:26.990 --> 00:25:32.519
The second is a very bad situation here is,
because every parent can go and interfere

00:25:32.519 --> 00:25:33.519
with the teacher.

00:25:33.519 --> 00:25:36.159
Because they think they are paying for it.

00:25:36.159 --> 00:25:39.580
You’ll spoil your children completely.

00:25:39.580 --> 00:25:48.649
Should never never interfere with the teachers,
never.

00:25:48.649 --> 00:25:54.320
With the school.

00:25:54.320 --> 00:25:59.330
I mean if you don’t have money all right.

00:25:59.330 --> 00:26:04.970
Again you can have a committee, to find out
if they really don’t have money or not.

00:26:04.970 --> 00:26:09.470
But if somebody says I have no money I have
no job all right.

00:26:09.470 --> 00:26:16.769
Somebody should help them But it should not
be a kind of a police force behind these teachers,

00:26:16.769 --> 00:26:19.869
or behind the school or behind the leader.

00:26:19.869 --> 00:26:23.100
Where is the money gone where is that gone
this that?

00:26:23.100 --> 00:26:27.330
Those who worry too much of money will never
have money I tell you.

00:26:27.330 --> 00:26:35.590
Though I lose money quite a lot, but I get
double I tell you, never a problem.

00:26:35.590 --> 00:26:40.399
I never have a problem of money, never never
never.

00:26:40.399 --> 00:26:42.529
One must trust.

00:26:42.529 --> 00:26:50.690
I’ll tell you one example, very nice example,
which shows how Sahaja Yoga works out things.

00:26:50.690 --> 00:26:58.230
I went down to Rome, and we wanted to start
a school in Rome.

00:26:58.230 --> 00:27:05.869
We saw the land everything is very nice, but
we had to deposit the money immediately.

00:27:05.869 --> 00:27:12.600
And Guido said: ‘Mother we need about sixteen
thousand pounds worth of liras to deposit

00:27:12.600 --> 00:27:13.600
this’.

00:27:13.600 --> 00:27:18.399
I said: ‘I don’t know if I have that money
with Me in the bank or not.

00:27:18.399 --> 00:27:21.059
I’ll have to see, but doesn’t matter’.

00:27:21.059 --> 00:27:24.759
I reached the airport and I was leaving.

00:27:24.759 --> 00:27:30.610
Suddenly, Sandra came with a packet and she
said: ‘Mother this I have saved for You’.

00:27:30.610 --> 00:27:34.539
I said: ‘What is this?’

00:27:34.539 --> 00:27:35.869
‘This is money, liras’.

00:27:35.869 --> 00:27:42.440
I said: ‘But why I don’t need I don’t
take any money why why do you give Me?’.

00:27:42.440 --> 00:27:44.029
Suddenly it struck Me.

00:27:44.029 --> 00:27:46.690
‘How much it is?

00:27:46.690 --> 00:27:47.690
What is the value?’

00:27:47.690 --> 00:27:49.320
She said: ‘Sixteen thousand pounds’.

00:27:49.320 --> 00:27:50.320
I said: ‘That’s it’.

00:27:50.320 --> 00:27:55.009
So I got that money from her.

00:27:55.009 --> 00:28:00.399
I said: ‘All right give Me give Me I’ll
take it, and give it to Guido’.

00:28:00.399 --> 00:28:03.419
I said: ‘Guido go and book your…

00:28:03.419 --> 00:28:07.919
He booked that.

00:28:07.919 --> 00:28:14.970
Then it so happened that, the whole thing
fizzled out, and he got back his money again,

00:28:14.970 --> 00:28:18.609
like a bad penny.

00:28:18.609 --> 00:28:20.850
So we were starting this Shudy Camps.

00:28:20.850 --> 00:28:22.299
I went there.

00:28:22.299 --> 00:28:25.669
Guido said: ‘Mother don’t change your
money.

00:28:25.669 --> 00:28:31.399
I have got all these liras with me.

00:28:31.399 --> 00:28:38.919
All the things that I had to buy were bathroom
fittings and all the, what you call the wc’s

00:28:38.919 --> 00:28:47.210
and all that, plus the, all the marble and
all the curtains and what not, every sort

00:28:47.210 --> 00:28:48.730
of thing.

00:28:48.730 --> 00:28:58.359
And do you know, in one day I did all that,
for such a big place like Shudy, in one day,

00:28:58.359 --> 00:28:59.359
really.

00:28:59.359 --> 00:29:01.369
It was a fast movement.

00:29:01.369 --> 00:29:07.049
And after that, I told them that you pay them
and send Me the bill what ever it is.

00:29:07.049 --> 00:29:11.669
I also gave them hundred pounds more I said:
‘These curtains are very nice also get some

00:29:11.669 --> 00:29:16.090
more for Me maybe, because they’re dark
shade’.

00:29:16.090 --> 00:29:22.549
And can you imagine when the bill came it
was sixteen thousand one hundred pounds.

00:29:22.549 --> 00:29:23.549
Exactly.

00:29:23.549 --> 00:29:27.169
So I had forgotten about hundred.

00:29:27.169 --> 00:29:33.610
I said: ‘How is it sixteen thousand, what
have you done?

00:29:33.610 --> 00:29:34.859
Must be some manipulation’.

00:29:34.859 --> 00:29:38.419
They said: ‘Mother no it’s, grace of God
it has worked out’.

00:29:38.419 --> 00:29:40.619
I said: ‘Then this one hundred from where?’

00:29:40.619 --> 00:29:41.619
‘It’s Yours.

00:29:41.619 --> 00:29:42.619
You gave us.

00:29:42.619 --> 00:29:44.830
You forgot, this is Yours’.

00:29:44.830 --> 00:29:55.600
Then we bought the land and sold it for double
the price and now they have an Ashram.

00:29:55.600 --> 00:30:03.830
But where people are stingy about money, think
about money, things do not work out.

00:30:03.830 --> 00:30:08.590
And also worth knowing, when we bought these
two very big Ashrams in Rome, I don’t know

00:30:08.590 --> 00:30:15.009
if anybody has seen them, here, very big,
two Ashrams we’ve got them.

00:30:15.009 --> 00:30:18.710
That too, I told him just be on the lookout.

00:30:18.710 --> 00:30:28.299
So he said: ‘Mother there is one advertisement
for a house, nearer the main road or something’.

00:30:28.299 --> 00:30:29.850
I said: ‘Main road won’t be good’.

00:30:29.850 --> 00:30:33.900
‘No no it’s quite in the inside but it’s
away from the main city.

00:30:33.900 --> 00:30:36.320
I said: ‘Have you seen it?’

00:30:36.320 --> 00:30:37.320
‘No’.

00:30:37.320 --> 00:30:42.409
I said: ‘I have no time now, you’re telling
Me now, and I have to catch the plane’.

00:30:42.409 --> 00:30:46.039
He said: ‘Mother I had no time to tell You’.

00:30:46.039 --> 00:30:50.510
Luckily that day we heard that the plane was
cancelled because there was some trouble.

00:30:50.510 --> 00:30:53.309
I said: ‘Very good, now we have got one
day’.

00:30:53.309 --> 00:31:01.470
I said: ‘Can you talk to the owner and ask
him if he would like to show Me the place’.

00:31:01.470 --> 00:31:08.349
The owner accepted, and We went there about,
three o’clock, reached there about three.

00:31:08.349 --> 00:31:14.009
My plane was about eight, to India.

00:31:14.009 --> 00:31:21.909
So immediately I saw this, and that amount
which we had spent, I mean, for the buying

00:31:21.909 --> 00:31:25.769
of the land had doubled and we could buy both
the houses.

00:31:25.769 --> 00:31:28.549
And it’s such a big land.

00:31:28.549 --> 00:31:29.559
Immediately I said: ‘Buy it now.’

00:31:29.559 --> 00:31:34.299
We bought it and I caught My plane and went
to India.

00:31:34.299 --> 00:31:41.100
Nobody will believe that in such a short time
we got that beautiful, it’s a very very

00:31:41.100 --> 00:31:45.720
beautiful school, and also very beautiful
area.

00:31:45.720 --> 00:31:51.379
Just see it worked out.

00:31:51.379 --> 00:31:58.389
So I have a feeling that, when you start worrying
about money it slips out somehow, nothing

00:31:58.389 --> 00:31:59.960
works out.

00:31:59.960 --> 00:32:07.239
To feel the grace is to leave everything to
God, now you do it I don’t know.

00:32:07.239 --> 00:32:10.960
You’ll be amazed how things work out.

00:32:10.960 --> 00:32:16.059
It’s beautifully, it works out and you’re
amazed because that’s how you know that

00:32:16.059 --> 00:32:20.700
you have the blessings, how God has blessed
you.

00:32:20.700 --> 00:32:26.179
Money is what, is the dust of His Feet.

00:32:26.179 --> 00:32:33.340
So, I told you when I came these people Customs
troubled Me I said: ‘I don’t know what

00:32:33.340 --> 00:32:41.190
they are going to have now here in recession’.

00:32:41.190 --> 00:32:42.190
But doesn’t matter.

00:32:42.190 --> 00:32:46.250
It’s not going to affect you at all, if
you are in a witness state you can see all

00:32:46.250 --> 00:32:57.489
that, and things will work out, everybody
will have sufficient money, but don’t worry.

00:32:57.489 --> 00:33:02.249
And the more money people have, the more they
are worried about money I have seen that.

00:33:02.249 --> 00:33:07.769
Those who have less in any case they know
that they have less so what is there to worry,

00:33:07.769 --> 00:33:13.999
like Me.

00:33:13.999 --> 00:33:21.080
But about school now, we have three classes
and I’ve already talked to Stephan, let

00:33:21.080 --> 00:33:24.200
him solve the problem.

00:33:24.200 --> 00:33:34.649
If you find anything wrong, you can tell them,
but no parents should go and disturb the teachers,

00:33:34.649 --> 00:33:36.309
absolutely.

00:33:36.309 --> 00:33:41.460
You have no right to do that.

00:33:41.460 --> 00:33:47.190
Even I would say, Indian school.

00:33:47.190 --> 00:33:54.960
Nicely all the people go, stay there this,
in which school is it allowed like this?

00:33:54.960 --> 00:33:59.840
After this, all those who have to see their
children have to stay in a hotel and see them

00:33:59.840 --> 00:34:03.450
only on a particular date which is being told
that you have to see.

00:34:03.450 --> 00:34:04.649
You’ll be disturbing your children all the
time.

00:34:04.649 --> 00:34:12.880
It’s not that anybody can go anytime live
there nicely, and interfere with the working

00:34:12.880 --> 00:34:13.880
of the school.

00:34:13.880 --> 00:34:20.230
We have to bring some system into it, otherwise
your children will suffer.

00:34:20.230 --> 00:34:27.810
Even the Dharamshala school was really absolutely
there were a visitation, of all these bhootish

00:34:27.810 --> 00:34:33.510
people, they tortured the lives of these teachers
there.

00:34:33.510 --> 00:34:36.929
This is never done.

00:34:36.929 --> 00:34:41.590
So now next time, nobody is going to go there
like this.

00:34:41.590 --> 00:34:47.060
I have told him, that if they’re going to
Dharamshala then they should stay in a hostel,

00:34:47.060 --> 00:34:53.380
and the children can also stay with you, not
hostel we can call it a kind of a, inn or

00:34:53.380 --> 00:35:01.610
it is a, can call it, what is it a, it’s
not a big hotel but a kind of a inn sort of

00:35:01.610 --> 00:35:02.610
thing.

00:35:02.610 --> 00:35:07.550
You can take your children there with you,
but you should not go to the school all the

00:35:07.550 --> 00:35:12.600
time, and sit with them, because even there
they have to study.

00:35:12.600 --> 00:35:16.960
The trouble is, Indian standards are very
high.

00:35:16.960 --> 00:35:22.450
All the children, though they have holidays,
only take holidays for one month and the rest

00:35:22.450 --> 00:35:24.520
of the time they are all studying.

00:35:24.520 --> 00:35:31.450
You’ll see how your children will improve,
they don’t know even how to spell c-a-t

00:35:31.450 --> 00:35:33.630
cat.

00:35:33.630 --> 00:35:36.960
Because of the interference of the parents
children are so bad.

00:35:36.960 --> 00:35:44.161
So now if you have real love for your children
allow them to grow properly, and you’ll

00:35:44.161 --> 00:35:45.850
see how they’ll come up.

00:35:45.850 --> 00:35:51.060
Another thing they have no immunity for anything.

00:35:51.060 --> 00:35:57.530
Like if there’s any jaundice, they are the
first to get it, if there’s malaria they

00:35:57.530 --> 00:36:02.270
are the first to get it, if there’s typhoid
they are first to get it.

00:36:02.270 --> 00:36:07.570
While Indian children have that immunity,
because I have seen here also, everybody is

00:36:07.570 --> 00:36:08.570
carrying the child.

00:36:08.570 --> 00:36:12.640
Don’t touch the child all the time.

00:36:12.640 --> 00:36:20.540
Keep the child away from your body, has that,
warmth which goes to the child also.

00:36:20.540 --> 00:36:26.420
Yes sometimes you have to look after the child,
the child must know you love the child, but

00:36:26.420 --> 00:36:30.620
all the time carrying the child like this,
I have seen many ladies who are in my lecture

00:36:30.620 --> 00:36:31.620
also, doing like this.

00:36:31.620 --> 00:36:34.180
Why what is the need?

00:36:34.180 --> 00:36:42.700
You make the child so much conditioned, and
the child cannot remain quiet unless you do

00:36:42.700 --> 00:36:44.060
like this.

00:36:44.060 --> 00:36:46.790
Massage the child nicely.

00:36:46.790 --> 00:36:48.330
Massaging is very good.

00:36:48.330 --> 00:36:51.710
You should massage yourselves also, but at
least the child.

00:36:51.710 --> 00:36:55.140
Let them learn how to take bath everyday.

00:36:55.140 --> 00:37:00.180
Everyday they must be cleansed, so that they
develop the habit of cleanliness.

00:37:00.180 --> 00:37:04.840
They never wash their hands, they don’t
want to wash their hands, and their hands

00:37:04.840 --> 00:37:06.180
smell, they just use paper.

00:37:06.180 --> 00:37:09.340
Whatever you tell them they’ll use paper
never wash their hands.

00:37:09.340 --> 00:37:12.400
The hands smell, mouth smells.

00:37:12.400 --> 00:37:25.810
With all your development, children have no
sense of personal cleanliness.

00:37:25.810 --> 00:37:32.290
We have to know that they’re born-realized
children, and that they have to have, a very

00:37:32.290 --> 00:37:38.150
different type of attitude towards life, as
the same way as the parents have to have,

00:37:38.150 --> 00:37:40.880
a very different attitude towards the school.

00:37:40.880 --> 00:37:47.130
It’s a very patronizing, and you should
be proud that you have such a school here.

00:37:47.130 --> 00:37:54.500
Thank God, they are not in the same mess as
you have been.

00:37:54.500 --> 00:37:57.560
It’s so much protection to them.

00:37:57.560 --> 00:38:04.560
So change your attitude entirely about the
schools, about the children, and look after

00:38:04.560 --> 00:38:07.840
them as if you are their trustees.

00:38:07.840 --> 00:38:15.610
They are in your trust and also, they should
know that you love them very much, as anybody

00:38:15.610 --> 00:38:17.050
else also loves them.

00:38:17.050 --> 00:38:19.620
They must learn how to respect.

00:38:19.620 --> 00:38:21.340
They must have good manners.

00:38:21.340 --> 00:38:26.300
This can be done when the children are here,
because they don’t know how to say namaste,

00:38:26.300 --> 00:38:30.620
they don’t want to say thank you, they don’t
want to say sorry, nothing of the kind.

00:38:30.620 --> 00:38:36.830
All the time they’ll go on asking why, why,
and the Indian teachers start looking, Indian

00:38:36.830 --> 00:38:37.980
children would not.

00:38:37.980 --> 00:38:43.140
Here they have no right to ask.

00:38:43.140 --> 00:38:47.210
They will all be brats here, I tell you all
the children who are going to all these schools

00:38:47.210 --> 00:38:49.840
whether private or to the municipal schools.

00:38:49.840 --> 00:38:55.780
But the other schools that are where there’s,
horrible schools are there here I know.

00:38:55.780 --> 00:39:00.030
Because anybody who comes from those schools,
we don’t want to admit them.

00:39:00.030 --> 00:39:03.820
We have had three of them, we sent them back.

00:39:03.820 --> 00:39:07.190
It’s cheaper all right, but we can’t admit.

00:39:07.190 --> 00:39:10.240
Three children have been sent away.

00:39:10.240 --> 00:39:16.950
If you feel that you must share your money
with your children, then see that they get

00:39:16.950 --> 00:39:20.390
proper education, proper grounding.

00:39:20.390 --> 00:39:26.950
Of course I am going to make a proper complete
sketch of how with the teachers, how to deal

00:39:26.950 --> 00:39:31.820
with the children, how to make them understand,
how to put them into proper way.

00:39:31.820 --> 00:39:36.090
But this is a very important age from three
to five years I think.

00:39:36.090 --> 00:39:40.860
Till one year they should be with the mother
and father.

00:39:40.860 --> 00:39:48.110
But mother should not too much also all the
time, handle the child, and should look after

00:39:48.110 --> 00:39:54.830
the child, in a way as if it is in her trust,
massage the child, look after the child.

00:39:54.830 --> 00:39:57.810
I’ve seen some children just go on crying.

00:39:57.810 --> 00:40:04.280
I don’t know maybe the mothers must have
been very unhappy, when they were bearing

00:40:04.280 --> 00:40:09.520
the child maybe they had a bad time, with
the mother-in-law maybe with the husband whatever

00:40:09.520 --> 00:40:11.560
it is.

00:40:11.560 --> 00:40:15.640
All the time crying.

00:40:15.640 --> 00:40:21.370
All right that can be corrected, but they
are our property and we have to look after

00:40:21.370 --> 00:40:22.370
them.

00:40:22.370 --> 00:40:26.270
But again I say that doesn’t mean, that
a mother should expect others to give bath

00:40:26.270 --> 00:40:31.330
or look after them all the time it’s not
so.

00:40:31.330 --> 00:40:35.420
So I hope you’ll use your discretion now
as far as your children are concerned.

00:40:35.420 --> 00:40:40.960
I am very much concerned about them.

00:40:40.960 --> 00:40:45.710
Now the story goes about, people start talking
like that.

00:40:45.710 --> 00:40:48.630
About the Indian school there’s lot of criticism.

00:40:48.630 --> 00:40:53.760
I would like to know how much you have paid
for the school, to build.

00:40:53.760 --> 00:40:59.960
It’s only your children studying there,
nobody else’s.

00:40:59.960 --> 00:41:03.150
How much money did you pay to buy the land?

00:41:03.150 --> 00:41:04.760
Nobody enquired.

00:41:04.760 --> 00:41:07.400
How much it has cost to build this school?

00:41:07.400 --> 00:41:09.730
Nobody enquired.

00:41:09.730 --> 00:41:22.760
But if you are sending about, ten dollars
for their food and everything.

00:41:22.760 --> 00:41:29.740
Hundred and fifty dollars for four weeks,
where they eat their food, live there, they

00:41:29.740 --> 00:41:34.050
have all facilities, everything, plus their
education.

00:41:34.050 --> 00:41:42.090
But that will be very much discussed.

00:41:42.090 --> 00:41:51.970
You have to know that it’s a very big headache
to teach the western children in India because

00:41:51.970 --> 00:42:02.590
every money has to be accounted for our FERanies
Foreign Exchange Regulations, and every six

00:42:02.590 --> 00:42:12.460
months we have to give the report, to the
Reserve Bank of India, how we are spending

00:42:12.460 --> 00:42:15.850
this foreign exchange.

00:42:15.850 --> 00:42:27.060
And they are experts.

00:42:27.060 --> 00:42:32.430
Despite all that, the people loose-tonguers
are saying: ‘Somebody is eating the money

00:42:32.430 --> 00:42:33.610
there’.

00:42:33.610 --> 00:42:43.010
It’s very difficult, you don’t know, to
manage the western children in India, first

00:42:43.010 --> 00:42:54.570
of all as they are, and then secondly, that
the government is on top of our head, they’re

00:42:54.570 --> 00:42:56.060
sitting.

00:42:56.060 --> 00:43:01.000
Then third is about food.

00:43:01.000 --> 00:43:04.840
Your children are used to tinned foods.

00:43:04.840 --> 00:43:08.070
Like they’ll say we want baked beans in
the morning.

00:43:08.070 --> 00:43:09.070
We want this, we want that, every child wants
something else.

00:43:09.070 --> 00:43:10.070
Now the people will go crazy cooking for all
of them separately.

00:43:10.070 --> 00:43:11.070
You have agreed to such a thing, all right
you want this habit.

00:43:11.070 --> 00:43:12.070
You should not compromise: ‘No, better eat
this’.

00:43:12.070 --> 00:43:13.070
He won’t eat today, he’ll eat tomorrow.

00:43:13.070 --> 00:43:14.070
Whatever is cooked for everybody in the family
please have it.

00:43:14.070 --> 00:43:15.070
And these tinned fruits I am absolutely against
it and I am sure you also don’t want them

00:43:15.070 --> 00:43:16.070
to have tinned fruits.

00:43:16.070 --> 00:43:17.070
They want to have, fried fish and baked beans
and potato chips.

00:43:17.070 --> 00:43:18.070
That’s all they know about food nothing
more, or less.

00:43:18.070 --> 00:43:19.070
So don’t send them any tinned fruits, foods,
tinned fruits.

00:43:19.070 --> 00:43:20.070
I think you better not send them any food,
is a better idea.

00:43:20.070 --> 00:43:21.070
Because if you send them chocolates, their
liver will be spoiled.

00:43:21.070 --> 00:43:22.070
They are getting everything there, so please
if you have to give you can give them clothes

00:43:22.070 --> 00:43:23.070
or anything, but not something to eat.

00:43:23.070 --> 00:43:24.070
Somebody brought lots of chocolates.

00:43:24.070 --> 00:43:25.070
That’s how they got this, problem.

00:43:25.070 --> 00:43:26.070
Chocolates should be avoided for children
up to some age, and also ice cream, but ice

00:43:26.070 --> 00:43:27.070
cream still is not so much fat, but chocolate
specially.

00:43:27.070 --> 00:43:28.070
You can have lollipops and all those things
they are perfectly all right, lollies are

00:43:28.070 --> 00:43:29.070
all right.

00:43:29.070 --> 00:43:30.070
Be careful as to what habits you give to them.

00:43:30.070 --> 00:43:31.070
And tinned food should never be given to children.

00:43:31.070 --> 00:43:32.070
It’s very bad.

00:43:32.070 --> 00:43:33.070
There’s some preservation, and for that
preservation they put some chemicals and that’s

00:43:33.070 --> 00:43:34.070
why the children are very susceptible.

00:43:34.070 --> 00:43:35.070
They have no immunity.

00:43:35.070 --> 00:43:36.070
It’s easy to get fresh things here.

00:43:36.070 --> 00:43:37.070
Not difficult specially in Australia, you
have no problem.

00:43:37.070 --> 00:43:38.070
Get them fresh things, fresh fruits, fresh
food.

00:43:38.070 --> 00:43:39.070
You should give them.

00:43:39.070 --> 00:43:40.070
If you form that habit and not from restaurants
and thing.

00:43:40.070 --> 00:43:41.070
See everything you get it in the market bring
it home, and just shove it into thing and

00:43:41.070 --> 00:43:42.070
give them.

00:43:42.070 --> 00:43:43.070
No.

00:43:43.070 --> 00:43:44.070
For children be careful.

00:43:44.070 --> 00:43:45.070
Once you spoil their stomachs it’s difficult
to make them all right.

00:43:45.070 --> 00:43:46.070
So be very very careful as to what kind of
food you are giving, even if you have to give

00:43:46.070 --> 00:43:47.070
something, then you should read what is in
it you see.

00:43:47.070 --> 00:43:48.070
If there are anything artificial things please
try to avoid.

00:43:48.070 --> 00:43:49.070
These are very precious children we have,
and we have to look after them.

00:43:49.070 --> 00:43:50.070
Again and again I would request you, to be
very kind, to Me by looking after them in

00:43:50.070 --> 00:43:51.070
a proper sensible manner, till they are with
you.

00:43:51.070 --> 00:43:52.070
Also you have to give them some discipline.

00:43:52.070 --> 00:43:53.070
It’s very important.

00:43:53.070 --> 00:43:54.070
By giving them self-esteem: ‘You are Sahaja
Yogis you are this’.

00:43:54.070 --> 00:43:55.070
If you give them, they have no self-esteem
at all.

00:43:55.070 --> 00:43:56.070
If you give them the self-esteem you’ll
be surprised they’ll start behaving very

00:43:56.070 --> 00:43:57.070
well.

00:43:57.070 --> 00:43:58.070
By saying that see: ‘You are special children,
you are Sahaj Yogis, you can’t behave like

00:43:58.070 --> 00:43:59.070
that,’ how they have to be.

00:43:59.070 --> 00:44:00.070
There has to be some discipline, otherwise
at the age of six years you cannot start,

00:44:00.070 --> 00:44:01.070
and even if you start it, it takes some time.

00:44:01.070 --> 00:44:02.070
It’s exhausting, absolutely exhausting.

00:44:02.070 --> 00:44:03.070
Some children are very exhausting.

00:44:03.070 --> 00:44:04.070
So I hope you’ll remember this.

00:44:04.070 --> 00:44:05.070
We have to be kind and nice, discreet, sweet
to them, but first we should know what is

00:44:05.070 --> 00:44:06.070
going to be helpful to them, what is benevolent
for them.

00:44:06.070 --> 00:44:07.070
And just some book comes about children, you
read it, done.

00:44:07.070 --> 00:44:08.070
In Sahaja Yoga you don’t have to read all
such books.

00:44:08.070 --> 00:44:09.070
I’m already going to write and I’ve already
told you these things.

00:44:09.070 --> 00:44:10.070
Just in a wider way, you use your discretion.

00:44:10.070 --> 00:44:11.070
After all you are all realized souls and the
spirit within you, can see in the light of

00:44:11.070 --> 00:44:12.070
that, what is good for your child.

00:44:12.070 --> 00:44:13.070
But avoid tinned food as far as possible.

00:44:13.070 --> 00:44:14.070
Anything tinned is horrible and please don’t
take that for your children.

00:44:14.070 --> 00:44:15.070
I think you people all need not also have
tinned food what is the need?.

00:44:15.070 --> 00:44:16.070
This cancer and all that so rampant, in the
west.

00:44:16.070 --> 00:44:17.070
In India, thank God at least what ever poor
they may be they don’t eat tin food.

00:44:17.070 --> 00:44:18.070
We can’t afford.

00:44:18.070 --> 00:44:19.070
In tin food is more expensive in India than
fresh food, because tin is expensive, luckily.

00:44:19.070 --> 00:44:20.070
All right, so now this is we have done, I
have a little present for your, leader.

00:44:20.070 --> 00:44:21.070
You’re an inch short of one pen, so I borrowed
his, and he said that: ‘Mother You have

00:44:21.070 --> 00:44:22.070
